WEBVTT

00:01:51.780 --> 00:01:53.660
episode of Dragon Ball Z.

00:01:54.180 --> 00:01:59.460
Vegeta made a devastating attack that blew the seemingly invincible Majin Buu to smithereen.

00:02:04.570 --> 00:02:08.350
It was an attack that left the Saiyan Prince without any life force of his own.

00:02:09.020 --> 00:02:12.600
The once cold-hearted Vegeta had made the ultimate sacrifice,

00:02:13.160 --> 00:02:16.380
extinguishing his own life in an attempt to rid the Earth

00:02:16.380 --> 00:02:19.420
of the evil Majin Buu once and for all.

00:02:21.500 --> 00:02:27.600
The solitary warrior fell to a stony death, leaving nothing behind except the hope that Boo was finished.

00:02:27.990 --> 00:02:29.950
That the creature would trouble his family.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:31.400
and friends no more.

00:02:36.390 --> 00:02:41.970
But when Piccolo arrived at the scene, he found that the elastic remnants of Majin Buu were far from dead.

00:02:42.820 --> 00:02:47.840
The Namek could only look on in horror at the amazing resurrection of the unstoppable Boo!

00:02:49.830 --> 00:02:54.510
In a bubblegum-like frenzy, the terrifying nemesis reformed into his original shape.

00:02:54.790 --> 00:02:56.090
Fully rejuvenated.

00:03:00.340 --> 00:03:06.880
Not faring so well was the wicked Babidi who angrily commanded Boo to use his powers to restore him back to full health.

00:03:10.940 --> 00:03:12.860
And the Duel of Darkness was back in action,

00:03:13.040 --> 00:03:15.580
ready to wreak havoc on the inhabitants of Earth once again.

00:03:17.400 --> 00:03:18.980
little quick in for those scoundrels.

00:03:20.210 --> 00:03:23.750
Elsewhere, deep in the forest, Gohan barely clings to life.

00:03:24.310 --> 00:03:28.050
But can anything prevent the young warrior from crossing through death's door?

00:03:49.220 --> 00:03:50.620
Six down and one to go.

00:03:50.950 --> 00:03:52.890
At least the Dragon Ball hunting's going well.

00:03:53.320 --> 00:03:58.640
That's right. And do you think we could pull over? I need a break. I'd love to drink.

00:03:59.080 --> 00:03:59.940
I just hope these

00:04:00.030 --> 00:04:07.300
things work. Oh, they work. You don't have to worry about that, Videl. That's good. But hey,

00:04:07.500 --> 00:04:11.280
shouldn't we be looking for Trunks and Goten, you guys? Isn't that a little more important than

00:04:11.280 --> 00:04:16.920
finding the Dragon Balls? Huh. What do you think, Bulma? I don't know, but Trunks and Goten could

00:04:16.920 --> 00:04:23.220
be anywhere. At least with the Dragon Balls, we know we're accomplishing something. And besides,

00:04:23.640 --> 00:04:29.700
I want to wish the people that Vegeta killed in the stadium back to life. I owe it to them.

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:31.480
was a terrible thing Vegeta did.

00:04:32.180 --> 00:04:33.660
We should be getting pretty close, huh?

00:04:33.840 --> 00:04:34.740
What'd you say, one hour?

00:04:35.160 --> 00:04:36.720
Mm-hmm, we're close.

00:04:36.980 --> 00:04:38.220
Just keep heading in this direction.

00:04:38.460 --> 00:04:40.120
I'd say another 15 minutes or so.

00:04:41.500 --> 00:04:42.560
Bulma, be truthful.

00:04:42.880 --> 00:04:44.580
It's one of the reasons that you're so intent

00:04:44.580 --> 00:04:46.120
on gathering Dragon Balls.

00:04:46.140 --> 00:04:48.460
Well, you know, that something's happened to the boys.

00:04:48.520 --> 00:04:50.560
No, I think the boys are okay, Chi-Chi.

00:04:50.880 --> 00:04:53.000
For some reason, I haven't been too worried about that.

00:04:53.480 --> 00:04:56.100
I did get a sick feeling in my heart about Vegeta, though.

00:04:56.880 --> 00:04:58.460
He might need to be wished back to life,

00:04:58.480 --> 00:04:59.980
but I don't think I want to wish him back.

00:05:01.280 --> 00:05:03.420
Unless he's back to the way he was.

00:05:04.710 --> 00:05:06.650
Don't worry, Bulma. He'll be fine.

00:05:07.460 --> 00:05:09.020
Vegeta's not one to be controlled.

00:05:09.470 --> 00:05:10.430
I hope you're right.

00:05:11.490 --> 00:05:13.970
Hey, we've got an exact fix on that last ball.

00:05:14.280 --> 00:05:15.660
Steady as she goes, Yamcha.

00:05:15.980 --> 00:05:16.280
Right.

00:05:17.360 --> 00:05:21.400
It's kind of hard to believe that you can actually wish people back from the dead with these things.

00:05:22.010 --> 00:05:25.710
Well, look at me. I was as dead as you can get, and I was wished back to life.

00:05:26.430 --> 00:05:29.070
Don't worry, Videl. Most people come back normal.

00:05:29.470 --> 00:05:29.750
Hey!

00:05:35.880 --> 00:05:39.040
Slow down Yamcha, it must be on that little island over there.

00:05:39.370 --> 00:05:42.430
The Dragon Radar says that it's at sea level, that's got to be it.

00:05:43.040 --> 00:05:44.120
Okay, here we go!

00:06:00.120 --> 00:06:01.560
Especially if you don't know how to land.

00:06:03.590 --> 00:06:08.330
Hey, the plane is settled. You can get up now.

00:06:14.160 --> 00:06:17.300
Hey, thank you so much. My head almost hit the wall.

00:06:17.460 --> 00:06:19.240
I think you may have saved my life.

00:06:19.400 --> 00:06:24.340
I was thrown viciously, just like this, when I hit something soft instead of the wall.

00:06:24.640 --> 00:06:27.520
It was you! I don't know how I can repay you.

00:06:27.660 --> 00:06:29.880
I could have cracked my head open, but...

00:06:34.580 --> 00:06:36.790
Oh! Let go!

00:06:38.390 --> 00:06:40.370
I was only trying to show you something.

00:06:40.550 --> 00:06:42.290
How to be a lecherous old man.

00:06:42.790 --> 00:06:44.330
No, I was just trying to show you

00:06:44.330 --> 00:06:46.670
how these rotation devices saved my life.

00:06:47.410 --> 00:06:51.230
Oh, shit!

00:06:52.550 --> 00:06:53.610
I can't help it!

00:07:05.150 --> 00:07:07.090
Are you sure that you sensed someone coming?

00:07:07.250 --> 00:07:08.390
I don't see anybody.

00:07:13.910 --> 00:07:15.670
Hey, what's up with the runts, you guys?

00:07:16.050 --> 00:07:18.050
Hey, do you have any more sensu beans?

00:07:18.400 --> 00:07:20.100
We're not running a bean factory here.

00:07:20.180 --> 00:07:21.300
You just took our last three.

00:07:21.620 --> 00:07:23.120
We're gonna have to start charging.

00:07:23.440 --> 00:07:26.220
I'm surprised that you haven't started charging already, knowing you.

00:07:26.820 --> 00:07:28.600
Hey, what do you mean by that?

00:07:29.480 --> 00:07:29.960
I live like...

00:07:30.120 --> 00:07:32.140
I don't even have a TV set.

00:07:32.420 --> 00:07:35.740
You don't have a TV? Wow, you really are roughing it up here.

00:07:36.120 --> 00:07:37.140
Let's famoose, Piccolo.

00:07:37.480 --> 00:07:40.600
That's right. All I do is grow beans for you in grates.

00:07:40.780 --> 00:07:43.140
I can't even get a pizza delivered up here.

00:07:43.360 --> 00:07:45.620
If you aren't so lazy, you could learn how to fly.

00:07:46.360 --> 00:07:49.510
Hey, he's right. I could fly my own pizzas up.

00:07:51.200 --> 00:07:51.500
Hello.

00:07:52.160 --> 00:07:52.940
And Krillin.

00:07:53.850 --> 00:07:54.790
Hello up there.

00:07:55.110 --> 00:07:57.550
How are you doing? It's good to see you again.

00:07:58.630 --> 00:07:59.970
Uh-oh. It looks like Trunks...

00:08:01.020 --> 00:08:05.840
Please, don't tell me the boys have been hurt.

00:08:06.260 --> 00:08:08.440
No, they're fine. Vegeta just knocked them out

00:08:08.440 --> 00:08:09.400
so they wouldn't interfere.

00:08:09.740 --> 00:08:11.300
They just need to rest for a little while.

00:08:12.120 --> 00:08:13.040
Oh, thank goodness.

00:08:14.240 --> 00:08:16.430
Then we should get them to bed. Popo?

00:08:16.760 --> 00:08:19.390
Yes, sir. I just washed the sheets yesterday,

00:08:19.630 --> 00:08:21.970
and I put fresh pillowcases on them this morning.

00:08:22.210 --> 00:08:24.270
Let's see. They can use Kami's old quilt.

00:08:24.410 --> 00:08:26.290
Yes, that's the softest one we've got.

00:08:27.100 --> 00:08:28.140
Thanks, Mr. Popo.

00:08:28.360 --> 00:08:29.080
My pleasure.

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:33.980
So then, I take it we haven't made any headway against Buu and Babidi?

00:08:34.600 --> 00:08:38.620
Hmm, I'm afraid not. We've been pounded so far, even Goku.

00:08:39.000 --> 00:08:41.560
I know it's been hard. I've been sensing the whole battle.

00:08:41.700 --> 00:08:44.620
You have? Then you can tell us how Goku's doing! Is he okay?

00:08:46.040 --> 00:08:48.700
Well, it is difficult to kill a man who's already dead.

00:08:51.920 --> 00:08:53.360
Yeah, I guess you got a point there.

00:08:57.690 --> 00:08:59.970
A little while ago, Vegeta's energy...

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:01.100
completely disappeared.

00:09:01.410 --> 00:09:02.470
Yeah, he's gone.

00:09:02.690 --> 00:09:04.510
His attack had Buu into a million pieces,

00:09:04.710 --> 00:09:06.030
but Buu just reformed.

00:09:06.360 --> 00:09:08.340
How do you beat an enemy that can do that?

00:09:08.620 --> 00:09:09.800
It doesn't seem possible.

00:09:10.000 --> 00:09:11.400
Hey, what about Gohan?

00:09:12.040 --> 00:09:14.740
Mmm, I can't sense him. I'm sorry.

00:09:15.550 --> 00:09:16.480
Uh, Gohan?

00:09:17.530 --> 00:09:19.130
Dende, what about the Supreme Kai?

00:09:19.330 --> 00:09:20.290
Can you still sense him?

00:09:20.770 --> 00:09:22.550
Oh, no, I forgot about Supreme Kai.

00:09:22.690 --> 00:09:23.410
I'll try to find him.

00:09:23.980 --> 00:09:25.900
Good. There's no way to make a plan

00:09:25.900 --> 00:09:28.200
until we figure out who we have left to work with.

00:09:30.160 --> 00:09:32.740
I sense him. You can sense him, too. Just look with me.

00:09:33.360 --> 00:09:35.720
Yes, I feel it. It's faint, but it's still there.

00:09:35.980 --> 00:09:37.600
Boo's power must have been masking it.

00:09:38.560 --> 00:09:42.000
Piccolo, tell me, do we have a chance?

00:09:42.380 --> 00:09:45.220
Given what we have and what we're up against, I'd say no.

00:09:45.530 --> 00:09:46.490
But nothing's certain.

00:09:47.230 --> 00:09:50.550
Ever since I saw Goku transform into a Super Saiyan,

00:09:50.750 --> 00:09:52.170
I don't rule anything out.

00:09:52.430 --> 00:09:53.130
I understand.

00:09:53.550 --> 00:09:55.470
You're saying we need a miracle to win,

00:09:55.820 --> 00:09:57.680
but that you've seen one happen before.

00:09:58.110 --> 00:09:58.550
Yes.

00:09:59.130 --> 00:09:59.450
So?

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:05.780
someone tell me where the heck we go from here if i were you i'd do what goku would do he'd eat

00:10:05.780 --> 00:10:14.540
the meal i just pulled out of the oven rather than fight on an empty stomach why not let's eat

00:10:15.630 --> 00:10:25.140
hey wait up really left us my friend can't feel it in my heart

00:10:49.800 --> 00:10:54.500
to be alive. We can't do this without you. You have to hold on.

00:11:00.250 --> 00:11:01.670
Until I find you!

00:11:36.490 --> 00:11:38.530
This will be a fun city to destroy.

00:11:41.110 --> 00:11:44.620
This is great.

00:11:44.880 --> 00:11:46.440
Bobbity and Boo, unstoppable!

00:11:50.750 --> 00:11:51.450
Button Boo!

00:11:51.650 --> 00:11:52.250
What are you doing?

00:11:52.430 --> 00:11:53.290
You say that, don't you?

00:11:53.370 --> 00:11:53.590
Boo!

00:11:53.830 --> 00:11:56.240
What are you doing?

00:11:57.020 --> 00:11:57.200
I'm going to cry!

00:12:02.040 --> 00:12:02.260
You

00:12:16.340 --> 00:12:16.500
You

00:12:24.980 --> 00:12:25.420
are.

00:12:26.580 --> 00:12:28.660
I found it, but I can't reach it

00:12:29.210 --> 00:12:29.970
How about some...

00:12:30.670 --> 00:12:36.910
No, dear! You said you wanted to do it on your own, remember? And get some aggression out!

00:12:37.070 --> 00:12:44.610
Get my hand on that dragon ball! The first thing I'm gonna do is throw it at Yamcha's head!

00:12:51.540 --> 00:12:54.180
Give her a break. She's a mother you know.

00:12:54.380 --> 00:12:55.960
Do it great! Come on, old gal!

00:12:57.290 --> 00:12:59.590
Old gal! She'd better watch it!

00:14:35.260 --> 00:14:36.840
That's one heck of a jump there!

00:14:37.810 --> 00:14:38.290
We'll be right back.

00:14:43.080 --> 00:14:44.580
expensive I'm not jumping in there

00:14:45.160 --> 00:14:46.520
What kind of lame excuse is that?

00:14:46.760 --> 00:14:48.460
Just take them off and go in your underwear!

00:14:49.700 --> 00:14:52.560
See, that poses a problem. I'm not wearing any.

00:14:52.920 --> 00:14:55.040
Yeah, right. I bet you're just chickening out.

00:14:55.750 --> 00:14:55.870
Hmm.

00:14:56.390 --> 00:14:57.350
What about you?

00:14:57.690 --> 00:14:59.930
Yeah, I'd definitely go if I didn't have this cold.

00:15:01.270 --> 00:15:02.190
Men are scared.

00:15:02.970 --> 00:15:06.110
Well, I'm not, but I don't feel like getting wet right now, so no.

00:15:06.870 --> 00:15:09.310
At least you were honest about it, unlike certain others I know.

00:15:09.880 --> 00:15:11.140
Chi-Chi, how about it?

00:15:11.830 --> 00:15:12.190
Hmm.

00:15:13.530 --> 00:15:14.810
You cowards, I'll do it!

00:15:19.480 --> 00:15:19.900
I can't-

00:15:25.500 --> 00:15:27.500
Gotta admit, that girl is brave.

00:16:14.330 --> 00:16:17.290
If no one else is going to help that courageous girl, then I will.

00:16:22.520 --> 00:16:24.320
All else fails, they nail you with the guilt!

00:16:24.540 --> 00:16:26.960
And now Bumble's gonna give me grief for lying to her!

00:16:27.320 --> 00:16:28.680
Oh, well, here it goes!

00:16:43.390 --> 00:16:44.850
Not while I'm here, Buster!

00:16:45.370 --> 00:16:48.010
No, no you don't! These are my favorite underwear, buddy!

00:17:00.350 --> 00:17:00.990
They're okay!

00:17:02.970 --> 00:17:04.350
Do you think they need help?

00:17:09.770 --> 00:17:10.610
Yes, Sugar.

00:17:10.830 --> 00:17:13.530
It looks like Master Roshi's going to handle it.

00:17:13.570 --> 00:17:13.790
No!

00:17:26.870 --> 00:17:27.710
Sorry, world.

00:17:48.330 --> 00:17:49.350
I've still got it, baby!

00:17:58.440 --> 00:17:59.660
one for the record books.

00:17:59.660 --> 00:17:59.940
Good.

00:18:00.280 --> 00:18:01.200
Come on, Master Roshi.

00:18:02.300 --> 00:18:03.920
What an attack! You saved the day!

00:18:04.540 --> 00:18:08.460
I know we usually give you a lot of grief, but being a dirty old man paid off this time.

00:18:08.580 --> 00:18:09.360
Hey, yeah!

00:18:18.870 --> 00:18:21.030
It's a re-catholic, isn't it, Martin Buu?

00:18:21.070 --> 00:18:21.390
Woo-hoo!

00:18:30.410 --> 00:18:59.150
Man, I feel like I was run over by a train.

00:19:01.430 --> 00:19:01.770
Oh!

00:19:02.260 --> 00:19:09.380
Yeah, now I remember. Vegeta figures. First the guy knocks me out cold, and then he has to take the last sensu bean for himself.

00:19:33.610 --> 00:19:34.590
So, Kakarot.

00:19:34.790 --> 00:19:37.830
Even you can prove helpless when you drop your guard.

00:19:57.930 --> 00:19:59.210
I wonder how the others are doing.

00:20:06.270 --> 00:20:09.610
I can still sense Buu, but I can't sense Vegeta or Gohan either.

00:20:09.850 --> 00:20:10.610
This isn't good.

00:20:10.850 --> 00:20:11.970
Man, how long was I out for?

00:20:12.170 --> 00:20:12.810
Too long.

00:20:14.670 --> 00:20:15.470
Something's happened.

00:20:15.990 --> 00:20:16.850
Something terrible.

00:20:17.760 --> 00:20:20.240
Oh, it feels like Piccolo and Krillin are back in action.

00:20:20.440 --> 00:20:22.020
They probably know what's going on.

00:20:22.620 --> 00:20:25.120
Gohan, I'm sorry I wasn't there for you.

00:20:27.330 --> 00:20:28.630
We're in a real dilemma here.

00:20:28.920 --> 00:20:29.980
Gohan and Vegeta are...

00:20:30.540 --> 00:20:32.120
Goku isn't anywhere to be found.

00:20:32.400 --> 00:20:33.700
How could it get any worse?

00:20:34.040 --> 00:20:35.780
We've been in tough situations before.

00:20:36.320 --> 00:20:39.600
Yeah, I know, but Goku always showed up when things got really bad.

00:20:39.990 --> 00:20:41.010
Like they are now.

00:20:41.940 --> 00:20:43.720
Sorry, guys, I should be more positive.

00:20:43.880 --> 00:20:45.060
That's the way Goku would be.

00:20:46.080 --> 00:20:49.360
Goku knows that to win, you have to believe that you're going to win.

00:20:49.720 --> 00:20:50.960
Yeah, he's like a little kid.

00:20:51.160 --> 00:20:52.140
He thinks he can do anything.

00:20:52.890 --> 00:20:54.780
Hey, speaking of kids, do you think it'd be alright

00:20:54.780 --> 00:20:56.200
if I brought my family up here, Dende?

00:20:56.620 --> 00:20:58.950
I'm not sure. What do you think?

00:20:59.190 --> 00:20:59.870
You're the guardian.

00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:01.720
of the Earth now at your decision.

00:21:02.110 --> 00:21:04.050
Well, technically speaking, it's not proper.

00:21:04.290 --> 00:21:06.990
But if it wasn't for you guys, this planet wouldn't even be here.

00:21:07.050 --> 00:21:08.910
So I say, let's bend the rules.

00:21:09.190 --> 00:21:11.230
Hey, great! Thanks a lot, Dende.

00:21:19.510 --> 00:21:20.130
Feel it too!

00:21:20.610 --> 00:21:26.190
I'm either hallucinating or that's Goku standing there.

00:21:26.530 --> 00:21:27.870
Goku, is that really you?

00:21:29.140 --> 00:21:29.580
Hi!

00:21:30.410 --> 00:21:31.950
He's real! He talks in everything!

00:21:38.430 --> 00:21:42.260
Hey, what's the deal? Why are you so sad?

00:21:42.340 --> 00:21:43.620
I thought you'd be happy to see me.

00:21:44.060 --> 00:21:47.100
I'm not sad, you oaf. I'm just so happy that I could cry.

00:21:47.660 --> 00:21:49.560
You're alive! You're alive!

00:21:50.000 --> 00:21:52.260
Well, I'm about as alive as a dead guy can be.

00:21:53.490 --> 00:21:55.970
Look at you. You look like you've been through a meat grinder.

00:21:56.280 --> 00:21:58.100
How about we get those injuries taken care of?

00:21:58.480 --> 00:21:59.900
Ah, Sensu Bean, huh?

00:22:00.350 --> 00:22:02.350
No, we're out, but we can do better than that.

00:22:02.650 --> 00:22:04.510
That is, if Dendi's willing to do some healing.

00:22:04.750 --> 00:22:05.930
What do you say, Guardian of the Earth?

00:22:06.200 --> 00:22:07.760
Well, of course. Certainly.

00:22:08.210 --> 00:22:10.760
Wow, thank you. I really appreciate it.

00:22:10.980 --> 00:22:13.320
Don't mention it. I'm honored to be able to help.

00:22:20.470 --> 00:22:23.650
As the weights of pain and fatigue are lifted from Goku's shoulders,

00:22:23.970 --> 00:22:25.970
his mission becomes more and more clear.

00:22:26.720 --> 00:22:29.960
With fire in his eyes, the Super Saiyan has only one thing on...

00:22:30.000 --> 00:22:33.640
his mind, ridding the earth of the evil Majin Poo.

00:23:00.000 --> 00:23:02.270
I used to be an angel

00:23:02.320 --> 00:23:11.960
I scattered the stars from the sky

00:23:11.960 --> 00:23:15.000
I wanted to erase the sadness from the stars

00:23:15.000 --> 00:23:19.200
The wide blue sky

00:23:19.230 --> 00:23:21.520
I'm sure

00:23:35.660 --> 00:23:40.920
There's still a lot of power left
